    Source:   https://github.com/knowvah/dot-engine
    Full text: https://www.eclipse.org/legal/epl-2.0/
               and node_modules/@knowvah/dot-engine/LICENSE

    The graph layout engine, a TypeScript port of Graphviz's dot layout (see
    Graphviz below, from which it derives).

    EPL-2.0 is a weak, file-level copyleft: obligations attach to the
