Optional packages
================================================================================

The packages under packages/ (stdlib, stdlib-aws, stdlib-tupadr3, stdlib-all,
sprites-archimate, emoji, all) are published separately, and each carries its
own LICENSE and LICENSES.md. Among them: the AWS Architecture Icons are
